{
    "title": "Fire In Music Battles",
    "description": "Hey BBoys! Time for night music party! Geometry night battles come!\r\nBF and Pico aren't here, it's time for GF to battle the Geometry face memes in some funny songs like Fire in the hole, Rock on the ground, Water on the hill, Wind from the landscape, and Air Detected but in a cover version.\r\nIf music be the food of love, play on. Dance through the digital night! Feel the rhythm! \r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (Impostor V4-V5, Silly Billy, El Chavo), climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow amazing melody\r\n- All mods Full digital enemies as you expected (Indie cross, funny circus, weekend 1)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Not require starting a new mode of play\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nSubcribe our social media platforms to jump into vibrant game community!",
